  "description": "How long is too long to spend in space? When astronaut Webber Jones returns to Earth after a 20 year mission, he brings with him an interesting problem. Due to spending the last two decades with nothing but an AI robot dog as company, he’s lost the ability to tell the difference between dogs and people. Of course, excitable psychiatrist Benjamin rogers isn’t expecting this case to be easy, but he encounters an unexpected problem in the fact that the handsome, mature Webber is exactly his type! The things is, it’s hard to treat a man who thinks of you as nothing more than his four-legged friend, and soon Benjamin realizes he may have bitten off more than he can chew… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
